# Files that belong to the repo, not to $HOME. Without this, `stow .` symlinks
# the Brewfile, the bootstrap script and the README straight into your home
# directory.
#
# Two things to know: these are Perl regexes ANCHORED AT BOTH ENDS, so a bare
# `\.bak` matches nothing - you need `.*\.bak.*`. And the presence of this file
# REPLACES stow's built-in default ignore list, so .git has to be repeated here.
^/README\.md$
^/setup\.png$
^/Brewfile$
^/bootstrap\.sh$
^/\.gitignore$
^/\.stow-local-ignore$
^/\.git$
.*\.bak.*
.*__pycache__.*
.*\.pyc
\.DS_Store
